  "body_html": "<p><em>This is not advice or medical advice. I am writing this in a personal capacity. I am writing this to record my set of actions before a potential pandemic threat. I hope nothing happens and that I am just being paranoid.</em></p><p>I heard of the <a href=\"https://irkutsklive.com/features/irkutsk-overnight-briefing\">quarantine situation</a> in Irkutsk a few hours ago. The quarantine involves a pathogen of some sort. There are photos of staff in hazmat suits on the street. There are estimates of hundreds of people in quarantine. The incident seems to be related to the Antiplague Institute, although that is unclear. The nature of the pathogen is unknown. It is unknown if it was a lab leak. It is unknown if it is plague, what type of plague it is, or if it is an engineered strain of plague. The transmission mechanism is also unknown. </p><p>The situation remains unclear. I have no reasons to trust completely what media is saying, nor what people on Twitter are saying. Reports from Russia have been heavily edited. Russian news is incoherent and confusing. I am not confident enough to say things publicly on Twitter or Substack about the incident; I do not want to cause harm by saying the wrong thing. But also, I have tried to make people aware that there is a situation. </p><p>Because of this uncertainty, there are two actions I have taken. These actions are cheap and don\u2019t cause harm. They pertain to my own sphere of influence, and I am comfortable executing them. </p><p>First, I have dug out my elastomeric respirator that I got from my local ScrewFix. Elastomeric respirators have a rubber seal and are reusable. This makes them more effective than N95s. I am to get another one tomorrow for my girlfriend. One uncertainty is what size of mask would be appropriate for her, so I will get her multiple sizes. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPL-!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9300c733-f03a-4769-b6f2-21fe7b872081_2768x3061.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPL-!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9300c733-f03a-4769-b6f2-21fe7b872081_2768x3061.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPL-!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9300c733-f03a-4769-b6f2-21fe7b872081_2768x3061.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPL-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9300c733-f03a-4769-b6f2-21fe7b872081_2768x3061.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPL-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9300c733-f03a-4769-b6f2-21fe7b872081_2768x3061.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPL-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9300c733-f03a-4769-b6f2-21fe7b872081_2768x3061.jpeg\" width=\"2768\" height=\"3061\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9300c733-f03a-4769-b6f2-21fe7b872081_2768x3061.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:3061,&quot;width&quot;:2768,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1619122,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topIm